        "text_hyQANj": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Synagogues, community centers, and event organizers ordering across multiple occasions can take advantage of bulk pricing on Jewish candles. Whether you're restocking Shabbat tapers for weekly services or preparing memorial candles for communal Yahrzeit and Yizkor observances, wholesale options are available to simplify recurring orders. Contact us directly to discuss quantities and pricing for your organization.<br/><br/></p>",
